  ozelFonksiyon: "tarot ge\xE7mi\u015F sohbeti ba\u015Flat"
  aciklama:
  - "Ge\xE7mi\u015Fin i\xE7in \"T\u0131ls\u0131m Sekizlisi\" kart\u0131n\u0131 se\xE7tin.\n\nBu
    kart, baz\u0131 \u015Feylerin daha iyisini, daha verimlisini ya da daha faydal\u0131s\u0131n\u0131
    yapabilmen konusunda hayat\u0131n seni e\u011Fitti\u011Fini i\u015Faret ediyor.
    Ge\xE7irdi\u011Fin \xE7\u0131rakl\u0131k d\xF6neminde bir \u015Feylere \xE7ok\xE7a
    emek vermi\u015F, o u\u011Furda zaman harcam\u0131\u015Fs\u0131n. Yo\u011Fun
    \xE7al\u0131\u015Fmalar\u0131n\u0131n tam neticesini hen\xFCz istedi\u011Fin
    \xF6l\xE7\xFCde alamam\u0131\u015F olabilirsin {{isim}}. Bunun olaca\u011F\u0131na
    yine de b\xFCt\xFCn kalbinle inanm\u0131\u015F, en do\u011Frusu yapm\u0131\u015Fs\u0131n.
    Konsantrasyonun bozulmas\u0131n diye nas\u0131l odakland\u0131\u011F\u0131n ve
    ne kadar \xF6zveride bulundu\u011Fun kart\u0131ndan belli. Asla durmamaya s\xF6z
    vermi\u015F ve y\xFCz\xFCp y\xFCz\xFCp kuyru\u011Funa gelmi\u015Fsin."
